SUMMARY:**FAMILY FEUD** (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out for fabulous Sunday afternoon\; with our beloved party game\,
  **Family Feud (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)**\n\n-It's going to 
 be a blast\; with this group social game designed to keep us laughing and 
 interacting all afternoon\n\n\\*Super easy to learn\, play and have fun- n
 o experience required!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we c
 an anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\nEvent Details Below:\n\nSincerely\,
 \n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n**Details of
  Event:**\n\n**\\*\\*FAMILY FEUD\\*\\* (Simply the Best Social Game in Tow
 n!)**\n\n-Lots of laughs in store as we have a great afternoon making new 
 friends and playing **Family Feud** hosted in a unique group vs group form
 at\n\n-Groups will be divided into groups of 4-6 players\, with multiple r
 ounds played\n\n\\*Chocolate handed out to the winning teams after each ro
 und we play\n\\*\\* Invite your friends or come on your own\; either way w
 e can anticipate a great time!\n***It's all about having fun and laughing 
 a lot :)***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only please) (
 HST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **steveflemming11@gmail.com*
 *\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n
 \n**Date:** Sunday\, November 15th\, 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive
  between 2:30 p.m. -3:15 p.m.\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub (1999 
 Avenue - Just south of 401)\n\\*Great lunch/dinner menu with food/drink sp
 ecials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to suppo
 rt venue)\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on a
 venue and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasan
 tandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15-20 min
 ute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber f
 rom the station)
