SUMMARY:Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nJoin us for **
 Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!** — a relaxed and friendly Sunda
 y evening filled with interesting discussions\, laughter and great company
 !\n\nWe'll explore a variety of topics\, including relationships\, friends
 hips\, travel\, music\, movies\, personal experiences\, work-life balance\
 , psychology\, spirituality\, philosophy\, the future\, human nature and w
 hatever else sparks our curiosity. We'll keep things lighthearted and stee
 r clear of political debates!\n\nWhether you're outgoing or a little reser
 ved\, everyone is welcome to share their thoughts\, exchange ideas and enj
 oy some refreshing drinks in a comfortable\, welcoming atmosphere.\n\nDate
 : Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\nArrive any time between 5:00 pm and 5:30 pm
  (if you can)\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub\nAddress: 1999 Avenue 
 Road\, Toronto\nMeeting Area: Back dining area\n\nJoined by my other socia
 l groups too :)\nLooking forward to a wonderful evening of conversation an
 d new connections!\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━\nEvent Details\n**Event: Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!
 **\n\n• Enjoy meaningful conversations on a variety of interesting and r
 elatable topics\n• Meet friendly people\, exchange ideas and make new co
 nnections\n• Relax over cocktails\, refreshments and delicious food in a
  welcoming pub atmosphere\n• Enjoy a casual\, pressure-free evening fill
 ed with laughter\, friendship and great company\n━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n**Friendly R
 eminders:**\n**Event Fee & Payment:**\n$5 per person\nE-transfer in advanc
 e to: [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:stevefleming11@gmail.com)\nOr pay
  cash at the door\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━\nFood & Drinks\nMinimum purchase: One bever
 age or appetizer per person.\nFood and drink specials available!\n━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━\nParking\nFree residential street parking nearby
