SUMMARY:Music Appreciation from the 1980s Social Event!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us for
  a fun and interactive Sunday night celebrating the incredible music of th
 e 1980s! We’ll listen to great songs\, share memories and opinions\, and
  talk about the artists and music that helped define this awesome decade o
 f music!\nㅤ\nThis is more than just listening to music — everyone is e
 ncouraged to participate! Whether you grew up with these songs or simply l
 ove discovering great music from the past\, come spend an enjoyable evenin
 g with friends and fellow music lovers.\nㅤ\n\\*Joined by my other social
  groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friend
 ly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Phea
 sant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawren
 ce - south of the 401 **(we will be in the back dining area)**\n\n*\\*You 
 can ask the bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for
  Steve's event-easy to find)*\n\n-You'll find it's a cozy\, relaxed and en
 joyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**
 \n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Hos
 t)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Music Appreciation from the 1980s Social Event!**\
 n\n• Listen and learn about the great music from the 1980s\n• Share yo
 ur favourite songs\, singers\, albums and bands\n• Take part in fun\, in
 teractive music discussions\n• Hear some forgotten gems and rediscover o
 ld favourites\n• Meet other people who enjoy music and good conversation
 \nㅤ\nCome listen\, reminisce\, laugh and enjoy a Sunday night of great m
 usic and great company!\n\n**Steve Flemming** has been a DJ since the earl
 y 2000s with a lifelong passion for music\, especially from the 1960s\, 
 ’70s and ’80s. Raised by a father who was also a DJ during the ’70s 
 and ’80s\, music has always been a big part of Steve’s life. He enjoys
  sharing great songs and bringing people together through music.\n\n**Even
 t Fee:** 5 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfe
 r: steveflemming11@gmail.com\n\\*No extra charge for those attending the e
 arlier event\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6:00 p
 m and 8:00 pm (if you can)\n-arrive earlier if you like) (please ask for S
 teve when you arrive\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n
 (One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Par
 king and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free r
 esidential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(1
 5-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus o
 r uber from the station)
