SUMMARY:Saturday Night Dinner and Disco Party! (November 21st)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle\, make new friends\, dinner par
 ty and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Disco Band!\n\n\\*Joined 
 by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out w
 ith lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**\\*Meet us in
 side Smoke Show between 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm**\n\\*If you have to arrive af
 ter that\, still let the front door guy know you are with Steve's group so
  he can direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive between 6:00 p
 m and 8:00 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank you!\n\n(Event
  Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEve
 nt Details:\n**Saturday Night Dinner and Disco Party! (with Live Band\, DJ
  and Dancing after)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food\
 , reserved seating\, Live Disco Band\, DJ and Dancing!\n-Super fun atmosph
 ere at one of Toronto's most iconic Music venues\n-Pool Table available\n-
 Plenty of parking all around the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Stat
 ion\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is incl
 uded)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Stev
 eflemming11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please)\n\n(1 
 minute walk from the new Mt. Pleasant & Eglinton station)
